Package: ResponsibleAgenticAI
Type: Package
Title: Responsible Use of Agentic AI
Version: 1.0.0
Author: Matt Paul and Thomas Carroll.
Maintainer: Thomas Carroll <tc.infomatics@gmail.com>
Description: Dependency + system-requirements manifest for the course. The course
    content lives in the flat top-level folders (presentations/, exercises/,
    descriptions/, data/, imgs/) and is rendered by the compileCourses engine;
    this thin package exists only to declare the packages the course needs so
    they can be installed and listed on the front page.
License: GPL (>= 2)
Depends: methods
Imports: ggplot2, dplyr, ggrepel, scales, commonmark
SystemRequirements: LLM.GUI
biocViews: Training
